### Resume after server restart

From the repository root:

```powershell
git pull --ff-only origin main
conda activate prior-templates-cnns

.\run\run_architecture_robustness.ps1 `
  -OutputRoot "$env:LOCALAPPDATA\prior-templates-cnns\results\architecture_robustness_cuda_001" `
  -TrainDevice cuda `
  -TrainWorkers 1 `
  -EvalDevice cuda `
  -EvalBatchSize 256
```

Training will skip all 25,600 completed models. Evaluation skips completed per-model JSONs.

